# QA M5 flow (D-047, D-072, D-081): Hackl Resi through St. Wolfgang and the
# Wolfgangsee, then the teaser to Strobl and the title. Title flow with the
# run started at St. Wolfgang: the first 6470 frames of
# qa_m4_flow_st_wolfgang_hackl_to_wolfgangsee (the qa_st_wolfgang_relaxed
# inputs, Hackl from 4305, Maibaum 5491, the map in Wait, the Wolfgangsee
# intro at 6320 drawing `player_hackl`), then from 6470 a route through
# the Wolfgangsee found by a scratch beam search that keeps the Hackl
# (never hurt): Wolfgangsee clear at 11016 as Hackl, the tally, the route
# map Wolfgangsee -> Strobl (11556), which has no level yet, so the teaser
# („Fortsetzung folgt …", from ~11632, with `player_hackl` on the map and
# St. Wolfgang's raised label, D-072), then the title (11812) with the run
# reset to its first stage, Normal, score 0. Shots: the teaser as Hackl
# (11700). The Normal-form teaser is wolfgangsee_tour's `teaser` shot.
